{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17360","headline":"晓发武阳馆即事书情 · 权德舆","name":"晓发武阳馆即事书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨策羸车，嘲唽闻村鸡。\n行将骑吏亲，日与情爱暌。\n东风变林樾，南亩事耕犂。\n青菰冒白水，方塘接广畦。\n杂英被长坂，野草蔓幽蹊。\n泻卤成沃壤，枯株发柔荑。\n芳树莺命雏，深林麏引麑。\n杳杳途未极，团团日已西。\n哲士务缨弁，鄙夫恋蓬藜。\n终当税尘驾，盥濯依春溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}